flowchart TD
    %% a domain that reviews changes
    edit[Author edits an engram] --> overlay[Draft row in the overlay]
    overlay --> share{Ask for review?}
    share -->|not yet| overlay
    share -->|yes| link[Share link minted]
    link --> reviewer[Reviewer reads the draft]
    reviewer --> verdict{Approve?}
    verdict -->|changes| overlay
    verdict -->|approve| folder[Write into the domain folder]
    folder --> index[(Index)]

    classDef draft fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#c90
    class overlay,link draft
